# The 6+ striation is one effect across layers (CR 721.2b, 613.6): an older Dress Down cannot stop its ability and
# base-P/T parts after its type part applies. The granted static's timestamp is the Sphere's (CR 613.7a), so it gives
# both the Sphere and Memnite flying after the older Dress Down. A later Dress Down removes that ability instead,
# but the Sphere still has base power and toughness 5/5. Seven counters also checks that 6+ means at least six.

